  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> of hydrogen diffuses out through a small hole from a vessel in <math><mn>20</mn></math> minutes. Calculate the time (in minutes) needed for <math><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> of oxygen to diffuse out"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "64",
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>40</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> will diffuse in t min. then. <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>40</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>50</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo> </mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>50</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>32</mtext></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>50</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mtext>40</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>50</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>80</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>40</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>80</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>50</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>64&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
